---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const tiers = [
  {
    number: 1,
    title: "Discovery",
    description: "From iNES header to PPU control: 6502 assembly fundamentals, ROM structure, VBlank timing, PPUSTATUS, PPUADDR, PPUDATA, palette RAM, background rendering, interrupt vectors (NMI, Reset, IRQ). Build working ROMs that run on real hardware.",
    lessonCount: 1,
    duration: "15-25 minutes",
    status: "in_progress",
    url: "/nintendo-entertainment-system/phase-1/tier-1"
  }
];
---

<Layout
  title="Phase 1: Assembly Foundation - Nintendo Entertainment System"
  description="Learn NES programming in 6502 assembly. Master PPU initialization, ROM structure, and hardware fundamentals. Build programs that run on real hardware."
>
  <style>
    .course-hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e30613 0%, #ff6b6b 100%);
      color: white;
      padding: var(--space-16) var(--space-4);
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .course-hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      background-image:
        repeating-linear-gradient(
          0deg,
          transparent,
          transparent 2px,
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 2px,
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 4px
        );
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .course-title {
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
      text-shadow: 3px 3px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .course-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      opacity: 0.95;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
    }

    .course-description {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto var(--space-8);
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      opacity: 0.95;
    }

    .course-stats {
      display: flex;
      gap: var(--space-8);
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .stat-item {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .stat-value {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    }

    .stat-label {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      opacity: 0.9;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .content-container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 var(--space-4);
    }

    .intro-section {
      background: var(--color-surface);
      border: 2px solid #e30613;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: var(--space-8);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .intro-section h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .intro-section p {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.8;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto var(--space-4);
    }

    .tier-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: var(--space-6);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-16);
    }

    .tier-card {
      background: var(--color-surface);
      border: 2px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: var(--space-8);
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--color-text);
      transition: all var(--transition-base);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .tier-card:hover {
      border-color: #e30613;
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(227, 6, 19, 0.15);
    }

    .tier-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-4);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    }

    .tier-number {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e30613 0%, #ff6b6b 100%);
      color: white;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .tier-title-block {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .tier-label {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
    }

    .tier-title {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .tier-description {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .tier-meta {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding-top: var(--space-4);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    }

    .tier-lessons {
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .tier-duration {
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    .cta-section {
      text-align: center;
      padding: var(--space-16) 0;
    }

    .cta-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .cta-description {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto var(--space-6);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-8);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e30613 0%, #ff6b6b 100%);
      color: white;
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      transition: all var(--transition-base);
    }

    .cta-button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(227, 6, 19, 0.3);
    }

    .back-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-2);
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
    }

    .back-link:hover {
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .wip-notice {
      background: #fff3cd;
      border: 2px solid #ffc107;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: var(--space-6);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
      color: #856404;
    }

    .wip-notice h3 {
      color: #856404;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .tier-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <!-- Course Hero -->
  <section class="course-hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1 class="course-title">PHASE 1: ASSEMBLY FOUNDATION</h1>
      <p class="course-subtitle">Direct Hardware Programming in 6502</p>

      <p class="course-description">
        Learn NES programming in 6502 assembly from first principles. The NES has no BASIC interpreter—you write
        assembly code that talks directly to the hardware. Master PPU initialization, ROM structure, and the minimal
        setup every NES game must perform.
      </p>

      <div class="course-stats">
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-value">1</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Lesson Available</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-value">6502</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Assembly</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-value">15-25</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Minutes</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Course Content -->
  <div class="content-container">
    <a href="/nintendo-entertainment-system" class="back-link">
      ← Back to Nintendo Entertainment System
    </a>

    <div class="wip-notice">
      <h3>🚧 Work In Progress</h3>
      <p>
        NES lessons are being added incrementally. Tier 1 has begun with the first lesson.
        More lessons coming soon covering sprites, nametables, scrolling, and CHR-ROM.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Introduction -->
    <section class="intro-section">
      <h2>What You'll Learn</h2>
      <p>
        Phase 1 teaches complete NES game development in 6502 assembly. Unlike the C64, Spectrum, or Amiga,
        the NES has no BASIC interpreter—you write assembly code that runs directly on the 6502 CPU and talks
        to the PPU (Picture Processing Unit) via memory-mapped registers. Master the iNES ROM format, VBlank timing,
        palette RAM, and the minimal initialization sequence every NES game must perform.
      </p>
      <p>
        Start with a simple ROM that displays a solid colour, progress through sprites and nametables, and build
        toward complete games. By the end of Phase 1, you'll understand the NES architecture from the ground up
        and have created ROMs that run on real hardware via flash cart.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Tier Grid -->
    <section>
      <div class="tier-grid">
        {tiers.map(tier => (
          <a href={tier.url} class="tier-card">
            <div class="tier-header">
              <div class="tier-number">{tier.number}</div>
              <div class="tier-title-block">
                <div class="tier-label">Tier {tier.number}</div>
                <h3 class="tier-title">{tier.title}</h3>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="tier-description">{tier.description}</p>
            <div class="tier-meta">
              <span class="tier-lessons">{tier.lessonCount} lesson{tier.lessonCount !== 1 ? 's' : ''}</span>
              <span class="tier-duration">{tier.duration}</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Call to Action -->
    <section class="cta-section">
      <h2 class="cta-title">Ready to Start Your Journey?</h2>
      <p class="cta-description">
        Install ca65/ld65 from the cc65 suite, boot your NES emulator (FCEUX or Mesen), and let's write
        your first NES ROM. No BASIC interpreter—just you, the 6502, and the metal.
      </p>
      <a href="/nintendo-entertainment-system/phase-1/tier-1/lesson-001" class="cta-button">
        Start Lesson 1: Hello, NES World →
      </a>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
